{"product_id":"buture-jump-starter-beta03","title":"Buture Beta03 Car Battery Jump Starter 5000A丨400 Lumen Wide Angle Light, Built in Compass","description":"\u003cp\u003eA car without a working battery is like a heart without a beat – essential and irreplaceable. Whether you're jump-starting a dead battery or maintaining one in a rarely driven vehicle, having a car battery booster is crucial. Enter the Buture Beta03, a powerhouse in the world of car battery boosters. This remarkable device is designed to effortlessly jump-start any vehicle, from gasoline to 10.0L diesel engines. With its smart clamps connecting to your battery's terminals, the Beta03 swiftly breathes life back into your car. Discover why the Buture Beta03 is a game-changer and one of the best car battery jumpers you can find.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003ePowerful Emergency Starter for Automobiles\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Buture Beta03 is engineered to handle any situation with ease. Its 5000A peak current ensures it can start any 12V vehicle, including hybrids, in mere seconds. The forced start function provides a double guarantee, enabling the battery pack to jump-start low voltage and severely drained batteries immediately, even in extreme temperatures ranging from -4°F to 140°F. This car battery jumper is designed to provide you with peace of mind, no matter the weather.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eHigh Capacity Power Bank \u0026amp; DC Power Supply\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBeyond jump-starting your vehicle, the Buture Beta03 also serves as a high-capacity power bank. With a 26800mAh battery, it can quickly charge your cell phones, tablets, and other USB devices through its dual USB ports, which are 75% faster than standard chargers. Additionally, it includes a DC cigarette lighter, allowing you to power car accessories like air pumps and vacuum cleaners. This portable battery jump starter can remain on standby for about 24 months, ensuring it's always ready when you need it.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eMulti-functional Emergency Tool\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Buture Beta03 is more than just a car battery jumper; it's a multi-functional emergency tool. It features a built-in flashlight with four modes: white super bright, orange SOS, and white strobe light, providing maximum convenience and flexibility at night. The flashlight can last for 48 hours, making it perfect for camping, traveling, and emergencies. Additionally, the device comes equipped with an accurate compass, ensuring you'll never get lost again.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eVisual Large Display\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe large, visualized LCD screen on the Buture Beta03 allows you to monitor the battery level, output current, and voltage at a glance. Its ruggedized case makes it waterproof, dustproof, and drop-proof, ensuring durability in any environment. The compact size and included carrying case make it easy to store and transport, making this car battery booster a reliable companion on the road.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eCommitted to Safety\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSafety is a top priority with the Buture Beta03. This car battery jumper box is equipped with excellent conductivity and smart jumper kits that automatically run 10 protections to safeguard against short circuits, sparks, and other potential hazards. This ensures that you and your vehicle are protected every time you use the device.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eProduct Specifications\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cstyle\u003e\n    .beta03-table {\n        width: 100%;\n        border-collapse: collapse;\n        margin-top: 10px;\n        table-layout: fixed;\n    }\n    .beta03-table th, .beta03-table td {\n        border: 1px solid #ddd;\n        padding: 8px;\n        text-align: left;\n        word-wrap: break-word;\n    }\n    .beta03-table th {\n        background-color: #EE6819;\n        color: white;\n        font-weight: bold;\n    }\n    .beta03-table tr:nth-child(even) {\n        background-color: #f9f9f9;\n    }\n\u003c\/style\u003e\n\u003ctable class=\"beta03-table\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eFeature\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eSpecification\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003ePeak Current (A)\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e5000\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eBattery Capacity (mAh)\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e26800\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eBattery Capacity (Wh)\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e99.16\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eCompatible Vehicle Types\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eAll Gas\/10.0L Diesel\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eProduct Dimensions (inches)\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e5.1 x 3.9 x 9.1\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eWeight\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e1.18 kg (2.60 lbs)\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eOperating Temperature Range\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e-4℉~140℉\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eInput\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eUSB-C: 5V\/2A, 9V\/2A\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eOutput\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eUSB 1: 5V\/2.4A\u003cbr\u003eUSB 2: 5V\/2.4A, 9V\/2A, 12V\/1.5A\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eSupports DC\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eYes (160W MAX with EC5)\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eLight Modes\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e4 modes: Lighting\/Strobe\/Orange Strobe\/SOS\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eForced Start\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eYes (smart clamps)\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eDisplay Screen\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eYes (large)\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eCompass\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eYes\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eAccessories\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eSmart Clamps x1\u003cbr\u003eEC5 Adapter x1\u003cbr\u003eUSB C Cable x1\u003cbr\u003eEVA Case x1\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003c\/tbody\u003e\n\u003c\/table\u003e","brand":"Buture Official","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45492414251263,"sku":"Beta03","price":109.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0621\/7462\/6047\/files\/buture-beta03-car-jump-starter.webp?v=1748247032","url":"https:\/\/ibuture.com\/products\/buture-jump-starter-beta03","provider":"Buture Official","version":"1.0","type":"link"}